# Lavafuel on the built-in lava scenario: turtle 4 at (0, 1, 1) facing
# north with 16 buckets and 20 fuel, a 3x3 pool of lava sources in
# front of it one level down, x -1 to 1, y 2 to 4.

check the whole pool when the target is out of reach
  scenario lava
  run lavafuel 15000 3 refuel behind 3
  seconds 120
  until done:
  expect turtle 4 pos 0 1 1
  expect turtle 4 fuel >= 9000
  expect blocks -1 2 0 1 4 0 air = 9
  expect turtle 4 item bucket = 16
  expect screen 4 scooped 9, burnt 9
  expect no-error
